#org @gText_ViridianCity_YoungLadyName
Young Lady

#org @gText_ViridianCity_YoungLadyAsk
Ah, hi there[.]\pI can change your Pok\emon's\nTera Type!\pWould you like me to change it?

#org @gText_ViridianCity_YoungLadyNo
Oh, I see[.]\pPlease do visit again\nnext time!

